{"4381000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Icarian", "steam_appid": 4381000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Icarian</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase. Close the distance. Strike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are IX, an android built for aerial combat, hunting down rogue mechs through the ruins of a world that already ended. No ground support. No mission briefing. Just open air and something fast moving through it that needs to come down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pure Aerial Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your targets don't fly straight. They weave through wreckage, hug terrain, force bad angles. Close distance too fast and you overshoot. Hesitate and the window's gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every engagement is a read-and-commit. Speed, angle, timing, get all three right and the hit lands clean. Get one wrong and you're picking yourself out of a rock face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.poster.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1170 height=782 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.webm?t=1779389167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.mp4?t=1779389167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting close is only half the fight. Chain together melee combos when you're in range, parry incoming strikes to punish openings, and dodge missiles before they track you into a wall. A dynamic camera and lock-on system keep your target in frame through the chaos, so when the moment comes, you can read it clearly and commit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcrafted Boss Arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter takes place in a tightly designed combat space built to push your flight skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current arenas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desert</strong> - Vast open sky broken by towering rock formations and dangerous terrain channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/62dbadd809a67e89059c0efab730b3ce.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ocean - A massive hole in the middle of the ocean with a pillar of water in the middle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/e9ef1b62aa44c0128ba66fbbc11a44e3.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1098 height=718 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No story holding your hand. No map telling you where to go. Just speed, instinct, and the next enemy in your sights.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Icarian</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase. Close the distance. Strike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are IX, an android built for aerial combat, hunting down rogue mechs through the ruins of a world that already ended. No ground support. No mission briefing. Just open air and something fast moving through it that needs to come down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pure Aerial Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your targets don't fly straight. They weave through wreckage, hug terrain, force bad angles. Close distance too fast and you overshoot. Hesitate and the window's gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every engagement is a read-and-commit. Speed, angle, timing, get all three right and the hit lands clean. Get one wrong and you're picking yourself out of a rock face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.poster.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1170 height=782 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.webm?t=1779389167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/657423ee9145a8014236d15515d82ee6.mp4?t=1779389167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting close is only half the fight. Chain together melee combos when you're in range, parry incoming strikes to punish openings, and dodge missiles before they track you into a wall. A dynamic camera and lock-on system keep your target in frame through the chaos, so when the moment comes, you can read it clearly and commit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handcrafted Boss Arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each encounter takes place in a tightly designed combat space built to push your flight skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current arenas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desert</strong> - Vast open sky broken by towering rock formations and dangerous terrain channels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/62dbadd809a67e89059c0efab730b3ce.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ocean - A massive hole in the middle of the ocean with a pillar of water in the middle<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/extras/e9ef1b62aa44c0128ba66fbbc11a44e3.avif?t=1779389167\" width=1098 height=718 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No story holding your hand. No map telling you where to go. Just speed, instinct, and the next enemy in your sights.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A post-apocalyptic arcade flying combat game. Play as a female android, chasing down and destroying enemy mechs across handcrafted aerial arenas. Master speed, momentum, and close-quarters melee to hunt your targets through the sky.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/a7ee1ac6b47f6e8a4da07b8683c826ff7394980c/header.jpg?t=1779389167", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/30468f9900523c1947d0ad3162793b600e3699af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779389167", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4381000/30468f9900523c1947d0ad3162793b600e3699af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779389167", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 (6 GB) / AMD RX 6600 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-12600K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X (or better)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti / RTX 4060 (8 GB) or better, or AMD RX 6700 XT (12 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ve